    "detailed_description": "It is said that the Magic Mirror knows all the knowledge of the world. In order to find this treasure, the brave team sets out for the tower of the magic forest.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are Five randomly generated paths filled with crises and surprises.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAccording to the characteristics and status of different heroes, move their positions to take advantage of strengths and avoid weaknesses, to overcome the difficulties step by step.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe thorns is everywhere and the monsters so scary? No matter!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n50+ treasures and 70+ blessings combine to make your team more powerful or interesting.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also potions and tools provided by the merchants to help you overcome the crisis.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow begin your automatic, casual,roguelite adventure!",
