    "short_description": "A team of four sets out on a journey to find the magic mirror. Change the position of the adventurers to determine whether they will be greeted by\uff1a monsters\uff0ctraps,or treasure\uff01 Your wisdom will lead the brave team through this wonderful adventure!",
